          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I return my order if I change my mind?",
            "summary": "Yes. You have 14 days from delivery to return most unused items. Conditions apply.",
            "answer": "<p>If it's not quite right for your home, you can return it within <strong>14 days of delivery</strong>.</p><ul><li>The item must be unused, undamaged and in its original condition.</li><li>Custom-made and personalised items can't be returned.</li><li>The return pickup is at your cost. Our team will confirm the price before booking it.</li></ul><p>Once we've collected and checked the item, we'll process your refund.</p>",
            "anchor_id": "change-of-mind"
          }
