            "summary": "14 days from the day your order is delivered.",
            "answer": "<ul><li><strong>Change of mind or exchange:</strong> 14 days from delivery.</li><li><strong>Damaged, faulty or wrong item:</strong> tell us within <strong>24 hours of delivery</strong>.</li><li><strong>Manufacturing defects</strong> that show up later are covered by our <strong>3-year warranty</strong>.</li></ul>",
