            "answer": "<p>Yes, as long as the item is unused and in its original condition, within <strong>14 days of delivery</strong>.</p><ul><li>You pay the delivery both ways: collecting the original and delivering the new one.</li><li>If the new item costs more, you pay the difference.</li><li>Your new item follows our normal delivery times.</li></ul>",
            "anchor_id": "exchange"
