            "answer": "<p>After we've collected and checked the item, we process your refund. It reaches you within <strong>7–10 working days</strong>.</p><ul><li><strong>Cash on delivery orders:</strong> refunded by bank transfer or mobile wallet (Vodafone Cash, Orange Cash, Etisalat Cash). We don't refund in cash.</li><li><strong>Card payments:</strong> refunded to the same card.</li><li><strong>Instalments:</strong> refunded through your instalment provider.</li></ul>",
