            "answer": "<p>Every Woodeca piece comes with a <strong>3-year warranty against manufacturing defects</strong>, from the day it's delivered.</p><p><strong>Covered:</strong> the structure, joints, fittings, hinges and drawer runners.</p><p><strong>Not covered:</strong></p><ul><li>damage from misuse, water or heat</li><li>normal wear and tear</li><li>repairs or changes not made by Woodeca</li></ul><p>To make a claim, contact us with your order number and photos. We'll repair or replace the part or the item.</p>",
